url: "https://ois.co.il"
keywords:
  - synthetic data
  - synthpop
  - statistical disclosure control
  - CART
  - privacy
  - secure research
  - microdata
abstract: >-
  oissyntheticdata is a zero-dependency, pure-Python implementation of sequential
  CART synthesis in the synthpop tradition, including relational (multi-table)
  synthesis that preserves referential integrity. It is designed for the
  develop-on-synthetic, run-on-real workflow used in secure research environments,
  where the synthetic data supports off-site development and the final analysis is
  run on the confidential data on-premises. Maintained by Dr Yohanan Ouaknine.
